-w-[820px] font-display text-[clamp(34px,5vw,58px)] font-semibold leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.025em]\">Will this fixed fee actually make money?</h1><p class=\"lead mx-auto mt-5\">Lay out the team, the rates, and the fee, and see your cost to deliver, blended rate, and gross margin before the proposal goes out. Free, no signup.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>No signup</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>USD or INR</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Built for services firms</span></div></section><div class=\"pt-12\"><div class=\"wrap pb-[80px]\"><div class=\"grid gap-7 lg:grid-cols-[440px_1fr]\"><aside class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-[88px] lg:self-start\"><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>The engagement</div><div class=\"inline-flex rounded-full border border-line p-0.5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[12px] font-semibold transition-colors text-muted hover:text-ink\">₹<!-- --> <!-- -->INR</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[12px] font-semibold transition-colors bg-ink text-white\">$<!-- --> <!-- -->USD</button></div></div><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]\">Will this fee make money?</h2><div class=\"mt-5\"><label class=\"block\"><div class=\"mb-1.5 flex items-baseline justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink\">Your quoted fixed fee</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-muted\">The price on the proposal</span></div><div class=\"relative\"><span class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[14px] text-muted\">$</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"10000000\" step=\"100\" class=\"input pl-7\" value=\"55000\"/></div></label></div><div class=\"mt-6\"><div class=\"mb-2 flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink\">Team on the engagement</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-muted\">Hours and rates per role</span></div><div class=\"space-y-2.5\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-canvas/50 p-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink focus:border-accent focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/20\" aria-label=\"Role name\" value=\"Partner\"/><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove Partner\" class=\"grid h-7 w-7 flex-none place-items-center rounded-lg border border-line text-muted transition-colors hover:border-red-300 hover:text-red-500\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"mt-2 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2\"><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"mb-1 block text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-muted\">Hours</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100000\" step=\"1\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-line bg-white px-2 py-1.5 text-[13px] tabular-nums text-ink focus:border-accent focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/20\" value=\"20\"/></label><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"mb-1 block text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-muted\">Cost $/hr</span><input type=\"numb